export const content = "<p>Dotonbori is a famous shopping and food street in Osaka. A must when you go here!</p>\n<p>You will be needing the whole day &amp; night to walk around here and should be on an empty stomach to eat all the food you can!</p>\n<p>It&#8217;s always packed with tourists all over the place. There are also famous areas here like the mechanical big crab &amp; glico running man.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-882\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_181820_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20160417_181820_HDR\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-891\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_183249_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20160417_183249_HDR\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-892\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_183533_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-897\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_184804_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-904\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_185721_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-905\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_185859_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-907\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_190308_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_911\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-911 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_190937_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Billboards at Ebisu Bridge on the Dotonbori canal</figcaption></figure>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote><p>One of the area&#8217;s most prominent features, a billboard for confectionery company Glico displaying the image of a runner crossing a finishing line, is seen as an icon of Osaka within Japan.</p></blockquote>\n<figure id=\"attachment_915\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-915 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_191206_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">The famous glico running man billboard in Dotonbori, Osaka, Japan</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Ooooohhhh! The famous Pablo cheesecake! I really felt happy when I saw this! It&#8217;s like I want to go there and eat all their cheesecake! Haha! Need to fall in a long line first though.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-920\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_192052_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"wp-image-922 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_192214_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"847\" height=\"1506\" />  <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-924\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_193941_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>You can choose the how it&#8217;s cook from either rare or medium. rare is a bit gooey &#8211; recommended!</p>\n<p>This one can go for 6 hours before going off if not placed inside the fridge.</p>\n<p>Definitely worth the wait! It was actually love at first bite! Haha</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-926 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_194149_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"607\" height=\"1079\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_929\" style=\"width: 606px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-929\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_194822_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"606\" height=\"1077\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">You won&#8217;t like the aftermath image of this cheesecake haha</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Saw this food truck has a long line so I fall in too. looks so good too! <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-934\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_200854_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>It&#8217;s a freshly baked bread cut in half and she puts ice cream inside it. really really really goood!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-933 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_200825_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"621\" height=\"1104\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_935\" style=\"width: 621px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-935\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_200907_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"621\" height=\"1104\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">The bread is warm, has crust, crunchy and goes very well with the ice cream in it!</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Japan&#8217;s famous food! Takoyaki and Gyoza. Actually the gyoza stall is Osaka Ohsho, a famous gyoza chain.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-886\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_182609_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"598\" height=\"1063\" /> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-894\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_183805_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"598\" height=\"1063\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_885\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-885 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_182601_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Takoyaki &#8211; a ball-shaped Japanese snack made of a wheat flour-based batter and cooked in a special moulded pan. It is typically filled with minced or diced octopus, tempura scraps, pickled ginger, and green onion. Brushed with takoyaki sauce and mayonnaise, and then sprinkled with nori and tops with dried bonito flakes.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_890\" style=\"width: 1243px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-890\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_183044_HDR-e1466494100452.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1243\" height=\"699\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Japanese chicken bbq</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_895\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-895 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_184253_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Gyoza from Osaka Ohsho (Japanese Dumpling)</figcaption></figure>\n<p>King crab aquarium. They are waiting to be selected and be eaten. Poor delicious king crabs.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-899\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_184936_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"size-full wp-image-901 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_185032_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_902\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-902 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_185143_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Grilled King crab!!! YUMMM!!</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Uncle Rikuro&#8217;s cheesecake &#8211; this is very popular as well. But I didn&#8217;t got the chance to try it. I was shopping at that time when I passed this stall and thought would just buy when I&#8217;m about to get home. Then when I came back they were already closed. too bad 🙁 looks really good though!</p>\n<p><img class=\"size-full wp-image-1164 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_193500_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1166\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1166 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_193650_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Looks fluffy and yummy!</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Okonomiyaki &#8220;Osaka Food Soul&#8221;  &#8211; Originated in Osaka and its most popular local food, a Japanese savoury pancake.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1089\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1089 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_220107_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">preparing and cooking okonomiyaki in front of you and serves it fresh</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1094\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1094 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_225546_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Okonomiyaki topped with sauce and bonito flakes</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1088\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1088 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_215208_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Famous ramen stall in Dotonbori</figcaption></figure>\n<p>It&#8217;s like a crunchy donut with a belgian chocolate filling in it. very very good!</p>\n<p><img class=\"size-full wp-image-1085 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_213055_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"size-full wp-image-1087 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_213154_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka dotonbori food crab takoyaki gyoza ramen\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br />\n<!--\n<strong>Other related blogs in Japan</strong>\nItineraries:\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-osaka-dotonbori-osaka-castle-shinsekai/\">Things to do in Osaka, Japan\n</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-tokyo-sensoji-temple-meiji-shrine-tsukiji-market-ueno-park-shinjuku-shibuya/\">Things to do in Tokyo, Japan</a>\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-kyoto-golden-temple-bamboo-forest-fushimi-inari-shrine/\">Things to do in Kyoto, Japan\n</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/things-to-do-in-fukuoka-japan-nanzoin-temple-yatai-ippudo/\">Things to do in Fukuoka, Japan</a>\n\nFood:\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/best-tonkotsu-ramen-fukuoka-japan-yatai-ippudo-ramen-street/\">Where to get ramen in Fukuoka, Japan</a>\n\nAccommodation:\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/where-to-stay-in-japan-tokyo-osaka-kyoto-fukuoka/\">Where to stay in Fukuoka, Osaka &amp; Tokyo, Japan</a>--></p>\n"
